ified and  wanted to make up for it a bit somehow  that stunt performer is now the owner of  a special silver pin hathaway had made  saying remember no one packs a punch  like anne  number 14. it's a bird it's a plane it's  a crashing parachutist one night a man  in scotland was watching on as some  high-flying stunts were being filmed  nearby for the dark knight rises until  things took a turn and a parachutist  crashed into the roof of a house right  next to him considering where they were  filming it's not too surprising there  were intense wind conditions that  ultimately caused the parachutist to  lose control and crashed through the sky  with nothing but a roof to break his  landing the accident was so brutal that  it could have been a fatal one but  luckily the performer only suffered a  few injuries  number 15. michelle pfeiffer's catwoman  was a wild one filming batman returns  saw the actress whipping around a  10-foot bull whip pfeiffer accidentally  cut her own face while she was training  but this didn't deter her from wanting  to carry out her stunts so she covered  up her injuries with makeup to hide the  truth from the production team who she  worried would make her stop for safety  the damage of the whip didn't stop there  though pfeiffer's whipmaster found  himself in the direct line of danger the  actress admitting i slashed his face and  drew blood despite the bloodshed and  injuries suffered the actress was a big  fan of using the whip feeling it was a  beautiful weapon  it hurts but oftentimes it works the  injuries are never fun but they come  with the territory of doing such intense  and action-packed films  whose injury do you think was most  brutal

